<p></p><p></p><p>Or from your IDE:</p><ul><li><p><strong>F5</strong>&nbsp;— build + run with debugger</p></li><li><p><strong>Ctrl+F5</strong>&nbsp;— build + run without debugger</p></li><li><p><strong>Ctrl+Shift+B</strong>&nbsp;— build only</p></li></ul><p><br></p><pre><code>dotnet run --project app-flyleaf                # Debug
dotnet run --project app-flyleaf -c Release     # Release</code></pre><p></p>